!set title=Somme des premiers termes d'une suite arithmétique
!if $wims_read_parm!=$empty
 !goto $wims_read_parm
!endif
oef2wims_version=3.22
author=Cyrille, Douriez
email=wims.irem@u-picardie.fr
keywords=sequence,arithmetic_sequence

ansorder=r
varcnt=7
prevarcnt=6
postvarcnt=0
replycnt=1
choicecnt=0
conditioncnt=0
feedbackcnt=0
format=html

val1=$imagedir
val2=$confparm1
val3=$confparm2
val4=$confparm3
val5=$confparm4

!if $testcondition=yes
 !goto test
!endif
!if $status=waiting
 !exit
!endif

tmp0=!randint -10, 20

val6=$[rint($(tmp0))]
tmp0=!randint 2, 15

tmp=!nonempty items -1,1,1

tmp1=!randitem $tmp
val7=$[rint($(tmp0)*$(tmp1))]
tmp0=!randint 6, 30

val8=$[rint($(tmp0))]
val9=$[rint($val6+$val8*$val7)]
t_=!rawmath ($val8+1)($val6+$val6+$val8*$val7)/2
val10=!exec pari print($t_)
val11=$[rint($val8+1)]
replytype1=formal
replyname1=
replygood1=$val10
question=__EXECUTED_1692754_EXERCISE__
solution=__EXECUTED_1692754_EXERCISE__

!goto stat

!exit

:question
$()On considère la suite 
!insmath (u_n)
$() arithmétique de raison 
!insmath $val7
$() et de premier terme 
!insmath u_0=$val6
$().	<div class="wims_question">Calculer la somme 
!insmath u_0+u_1+\cdots+u_{$val8}
$() :</div>	<label for="reply1">
!insmath \displaystyle \sum_{k=0}^{$val8} u_k=
$()</label> 
!read oef/embed.phtml r1,5 
$()
$()
!exit

:hint
$()
$()
!exit

:help
$()
$()
!exit

:solution
$()<p>Puisque c'est une suite arithmétique, on sait que 
!insmath u_0+u_1+\cdots+u_{$val8}=\frac{(\text{nombre de termes ajoutés}) \times (u_0+u_{$val8})}{2}
$(). </p>	<p>Calcul de 
!insmath u_$val8
$() : en notant 
!insmath R
$() la raison de la suite :	
!insmath u_{$val8}=u_0+$val8 \times R=
$()
!if $val7>0 
$()
!insmath $val6+$val8 \times $val7=$val9
$() 
!else
$() 
!insmath $val6+$val8 \times ($val7)=$val9
$() 
!endif
$() </p>	<p>Puisqu'il y a 
!insmath $val11
$() termes ajoutés :	
!insmath u_0+u_1+\cdots+u_{$val8}=
$()
!if $val9>0 
$()
!insmath \frac{$val11($val6+$val9)}{2}=$val10
$() 
!else
$() 
!insmath \frac{$val11($val6+($val9))}{2}=$val10
$() 
!endif
$().
$()
!exit

:latex
$()
$()
!exit

:feedback

!exit

:test

!exit

:stat
vsavelist=6,7,8,9,10,11
embedcnt=1
